{"id":12712,"title":"79 | CAT 生产埋点实践","content":"CAT 生产埋点实践的核心在于确保调用链完整性与降低接入成本。跨进程或异步调用时，客户端必须保存上下文并通过 HTTP Header 传递，服务端需从中恢复信息，以保证跨机器边界调用的链路串联。开发者可参考 CAT 源码中“框架埋点方案集成”目录，利用社区已有的 Dubbo、Elasticsearch 等第三方集成方案加速落地。\n\n在具体场景中，推荐两种最佳实践：一是集成 Logback，通过开发 Appender 拦截错误日志并上报至 CAT 服务器，使错误信息在 CAT 报错大盘集中展示，便于快速定位故障应用；二是基于 Spring MVC 实现非侵入式埋点，利用 AOP 技术封装自定义注解（如@CatTransaction），自动管理事务的开始、状态设置及结束。这种方式让开发人员仅需在方法上添加注解即可完成埋点，无需直接调用复杂 API。\n\n企业落地 CAT 时，应由架构团队统一封装框架层组件，屏蔽底层 API 细节，避免开发人员直接操作 Transaction 接口，从而简化接入流程并规范埋点标准。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":128780,"user_name":"Paul","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1050294,"ip_address":"","ucode":"7018DE791BBAE7","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/06/b6/4db00076.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1566961971,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":47890,"content":"什么问题？","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"杨波","uid":1030344,"ctime":1566999019,"ip_address":"","comment_id":128780,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":2,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100007001,"comment_content":"“框架埋点方案集成”已经没有了","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1030344,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/b8/c8/c94d38a7.jpg","nickname":"杨波","note":"","ucode":"FA3418BB703BCA","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":465099,"discussion_content":"什么问题？","content_length":5,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1566999019,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":2139807,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/20/a6/9f/3c60fffd.jpg","nickname":"青阳","note":"","ucode":"3591D366BAB0B9","race_medal":0,"user